== PSI-MS controlled vocabulary and Unit Ontology (CC BY 4.0), src/cv/generated_data.zig ==

The generated vocabulary tables contain data from two ontologies, each licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/:

- PSI-MS controlled vocabulary, https://github.com/HUPO-PSI/psi-ms-CV, by the HUPO Proteomics
  Standards Initiative Mass Spectrometry Standards Working Group and Proteomics Informatics Working
  Group.
- Unit Ontology, https://github.com/bio-ontology-research-group/unit-ontology, by the Unit Ontology
  contributors.

Changes: the OBO files were transformed into Zig tables. Escapes in definitions and synonyms are
decoded, OBO comments and typedef stanzas are omitted, and each term's ancestors and release
history are derived. The release, source commit, and SHA-256 of each file used are recorded in the
tables' resource identities. The material is provided as is, without warranties, as the license
states.

